ind":"update","title":"Demo Update","summary":"Added a Job Skill System — each role now has its own unique skills.Added a Weapon Enhancement System to improve weapon stats and unlock quality-based special effects.Added Production Defense missions to Endless Mode, where players must protect production from monster attacks and disruptions.Monster remains can now be dismantled for enhancement materials, which can be used to upgrade weapons.Reworked all firearm models and added weapon-switching, inspection, and idle animations.Added 8 new langua","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T08:51:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656395678","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4878890-1844751498233668","game_id":"steam-4878890","kind":"update","title":"Major Demo Update — Full 14-Day Campaign, Endless Overtime, and More","summary":"Hi everyone, I’m the solo developer of Factory Shift.This is a major update to the demo. The campaign has been expanded from 7 days to the full 14-day progression, along with new enemies, bosses, weapon customization, building mechanics, order options, and co-op changes.What’s NewFull 14-Day Campaign New story pages, creature research reports, and four boss evaluations have been added. Survive Day 14 and you’ll officially finish your probation period and become a full-time employee.Endless Overt","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T09:25:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498233668","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4878890-1844751498224920","game_id":"steam-4878890","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update — New Enemies, Full Destruction & Co-op Balance Ch